This directory contains the minimal Bernini-R renderer model stack copied from
the commit above. No model weights, checkpoints, media assets, training code,
or end-to-end Bernini planner code are included.

Local modifications:
- __init__.py exports only the vendored renderer model stack.
- models/__init__.py omits the non-vendored full Bernini planner.
- models/transformer_wan.py removes the optional Ulysses/VeOmni
  sequence-parallel path. Each process executes a complete renderer copy, so
  single-GPU and independent-rank data-parallel inference share one code path.

The v2v inference path, with one expert and with two, matches upstream
bytedance/Bernini at e6c2cf11843470b08491745947abcba9c3c6b079.
